{"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"records(at:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"required":true,"modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DeliveryTag.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/DeliveryTag.swift#L77"},"externalID":"s:6Events12AcknowledgerP7records2atSayAA11EventRecordVGSays6UInt64VG_tF"},"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u"],"anchor":"Acknowledger-Implementations","title":"Acknowledger Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The records this store still keeps at ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", read back for a destination whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivery buffer dropped them before it received them.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"positions"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdent