that still keeps one delivers it on a later launch, with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" set.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store of your own should implement it. Without it, the default returns no records, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch a full buffer dropped isn’t sent again in this run: the destination whose buffer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped it never gets it in this run, every destination gets it again on the next launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked redelivered, and the store holds it until then, toward its bound."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delivery gives each record returned the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitive-value visibility and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the record had when the buffer dropped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, so a store needn’t keep them. A record tagged with another store is ignored."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)"]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger/records(at:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6E